# Pixiv Func Replica notices

This repository is a modified work based on the public Pixiv Func project by
git-xiaocao (小草). The original project and its author are retained here for
attribution. The main behavior reference is the original beta56 source at
`svenfuss/pixiv_func_mobile@c62b18ccb92a64fedde81c8d5a2bc95cfc8f5989`.

This replica modernizes the Flutter and Android implementation, security
boundaries, network handling, media/download lifecycle, and platform
integration. It is not the original upstream release and must not be
represented as one.

The README images under `.github/readme/` are generated by
`tool/build_readme_assets.py`. The screenshots are framed with the Pixel 7 Pro
device art from Android Studio
(`JetBrains/android@b970f072653604910535171169ea4d9eef3580bb`,
`artwork/resources/device-art-resources/pixel_7_pro/`), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). The banner
text is set in Noto Sans SC, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.

The project license is AGPL-3.0-only. See `LICENSE` for the complete license
text. Third-party package and asset notices remain governed by their own
licenses; the resolved dependency set is pinned in `pubspec.lock` and
